  "description": "Outside front property, open enclosure lounge area for smoking and non-smoking visitors of existing restaurant/cafe with flat roof and skylights supported with structural stud-work covered with soft green decor, perimeter half wall 1m height all round (retrospective)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;break-after: avoid;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -18pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed enclosure, by reason of its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -18pt;&quot;&gt;siting, depth and appearance is\r\ndistinctly at odds with the pattern of development in the locality and has a\r\ndiscordant relationship with the host building and streetscene, to the\r\ndetriment of the character and appearance of the locality, contrary to the high\r\nquality design aspirations of The National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicy D3 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies GR1(Part C), GR3 and GR8 of\r\nthe Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
